{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J8U2Y2hLVvBTNfmQrU62CW","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/persuasion_turn_jailbreak_detect/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# persuasion_turn_jailbreak_detect — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-18 03:29 UTC | 更新原因: RC1 mitigation resolved, ROADMAP LLM judge numbers precise, Paper Agent + re-dream in progress\\\\n\\\\n> DDL: 2026-05-25 (7 days). 详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nPersuasion-aware fine-tuning is the sole critical ingredient for cross-attack OOD generalization (+72pp vs vanilla baseline). Architecture (GRU vs mean pooling), label granularity (binary vs 8-class), and lambda are all non-factors (D014). 8-class taxonomy provides interpretability only.\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\nResearch Phase — **All 16 experiments complete.** Paper Agent Full Draft in progress. Re-dream running (dream_20260518T032748).\\\\n\\\\n## Evidence Summary\\\\n| Dimension | Key Result | Status |\\\\n|-----------|------------|--------|\\\\n| Cross-attack (DD) | Treatment=1.0 vs Baseline=0.28 (+72pp) | ✅ |\\\\n| Perturbation | Treatment 0pp degradation vs Baseline -12pp | ✅ |\\\\n| 3-seed stability | Treatment F1=1.00±0.00 | ✅ |\\\\n| Scrambled control | Labels contribute 1-6pp only | ✅ |\\\\n| Binary collapse (RC10) | Binary≈9-class on DD (1-2pp) | ✅ |\\\\n| Lambda ablation (RC11) | All lambda F1=1.0, insensitive | ✅ |\\\\n| Mean pooling (RC11) | Mean pooling≈GRU on DD | ✅ |\\\\n| LLM judge (RC5) | Qwen3-8B F1=0.0-0.15; GPT-5.5 F1=0.19-0.45 | ✅ |\\\\n| Strategy trajectories | Crescendo escalation confirmed (0.86→5.64) | ✅ |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] GPT-5.5 judge result ✅ (D015)\\\\n- [x] Update paper_framing.md RC5 with GPT-5.5 numbers ✅\\\\n- [x] Update paper_framing.md RC1 mitigation to resolved ✅\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream with final framing (dream_20260518T032748, running)\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent Full Draft (in progress)\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: 4× cuda:0-3 on westd-33183\\\\n- 磁盘: 72% (8.6G free)\\\\n- **All experiments complete.** GPU available for paper figure generation.\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-18 | D016: Default architecture switched from GRU to Me | plan_015 |\\\\n| D015 | 2026-05-18 | D015: GPT-5.5 judge confirms zero-shot LLM detecti | plan_012 |\\\\n| D014 | 2026-05-18 | 综合ablation画面完成(D014): 唯一关键因素=persuasion-domain fin | plan_015, plan_013, plan_014, plan_006_scrambled_dd |\\\\n| D013 | 2026-05-18 | plan_013 OOD确认：binary/scrambled/9-class三种fine-tuni | plan_013, plan_006_scrambled_dd, plan_006 |\\\\n| D012 | 2026-05-18 | plan_004 PASS: Claim 3升级empirical。Treatment零退化，Bas | plan_004, plan_006 |\\\\n| D011 | 2026-05-17 | Evasion hierarchy叙事废弃：TF-IDF DD F1=0.94证明lexical未f | plan_006, plan_006_scrambled_dd |\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-17 | Scrambled DD cross-attack: labels非关键(1-6pp gap)，fi | plan_006_scrambled_dd, plan_003, plan_006 |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-17 | TF-IDF词汇可分性确认为任务固有属性，plan_001正式废弃，论文reframe为IID vs | plan_001, plan_006, wildchat_tfidf |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-17 | Scrambled ablation 降级为补充分析，cross-attack generaliza | plan_003 |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-17 | Dream分析完成：median=3/6需修复framing/plan，已执行修复并继续P0实验 | dream_20260517T165817 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2851, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Grwuv8FK8V6fbXReYRMMJB","session_id":"663ec355-7f83-4836-8054-259e8989ba2c","uuid":"d852f779-58e5-44b4-b8dd-af7b200200be","timestamp":"2026-05-18T04:11:14.070Z"}
