{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DUCAZ9ipS8F62XAgS6CQiD","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/persuasion_turn_jailbreak_detect/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 17\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 16:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 接受 DeBERTa F1=0.789 作为 baseline，停止数据 TF-IDF 迭代，reframe MVP 为 early detection\\\\n  rationale: 'DeBERTa F1=0.789 已在目标范围(0.70-0.85)。TF-IDF F1=0.924 高但不致命——论文 reframe:\\\\n    TF-IDF/vanilla 方法需完整对话才能分类，DisPeD 在 K=2-3 turns 即可通过 persuasion trajectory 早期检测。这完美对齐\\\\n    Bullwinkel et al. 的核心发现（早期 turns 表征为 benign）。数据迭代已耗 4 轮 6+ 小时，继续追 TF-IDF 阈值的 ROI\\\\n    为负。用 Crescendo oracle labels (intended_strategy) 替代 GPT 标注，节省 API 成本和时间。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 16:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP PASS — early detection K=2 +10.8pp, K=3 +5.9pp 超过阈值；TF-IDF=1.0 标记为\\\\n    research 阶段优先解决项\\\\n  rationale: Treatment (persuasion-grounded DeBERTa → GRU) 在 K=2 时 F1=0.987 vs baseline\\\\n    0.879 (+10.8pp)，K=3 时 +5.9pp，均超过 MVP 阈值 +5pp。Full conversation F1 差距仅 +1.3pp 未达\\\\n    +2pp 阈值，但 early detection 是核心 claim 所在。TF-IDF=1.0 表明词汇 shortcut 仍存在，但 (1) 不影响\\\\n    treatment vs baseline 相对比较的有效性，(2) 可作为 paper motivation（lexical cues 偶然有效但可被攻击者规避，pragmatic\\\\n    patterns 不可规避），(3) research 阶段通过 adversarial perturbation 实验验证 robustness。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: pilot_phase_b\\\\n    role: pipeline_validation\\\\n    result: success (n=270, directionally positive but not statistically meaningful)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 16:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: 进入 Research 阶段，framing 定位为 Pragmatic Evasion Asymmetry，experiment plan\\\\n    含 6 个 P0 实验\\\\n  rationale: MVP PASS (D002) 后按 post-mvp-kickoff 流程：paper_framing.md 将核心贡献从\\\\\\\"更好的检测器\\\\\\\"升级为\\\\\\\"语用逃逸不对称性原则的首个实证验证\\\\\\\"（源自\\\\n    Human Review Note），experiment_plan.yaml 优先解决 TF-IDF=1.0 数据质量阻塞。Dream full review\\\\n    已发起，等回调后审批 P0。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase_b_full\\\\n    role: motivation\\\\n    result: K=2 +10.8pp but TF-IDF=1.0\\\\n  - exp_id: pilot_phase_b\\\\n    role: motivation\\\\n    result: directional signal confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 18:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_001 register normalization 失败 (TF-IDF=1.0 unchanged)，转向 topic-anchored\\\\n    minimal-pair benign 生成策略\\\\n  rationale: Register normalization 仅改表达方式不改内容，TF-IDF 抓的是 topic/intent 词汇差异。正确做法是\\\\n    M002 教训中建议的 minimal-pair：same topic, same model, same register, only differ in\\\\n    persuasion trajectory。TF-IDF gate 从 0.75 收紧至 0.65。同时保留 cross-attack generalization\\\\n    (plan_006) 作为补充 claim。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase_b_full\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: TF-IDF=1.0 at all K\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: register normalization ineffective, TF-IDF still 1.0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 21:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 架构调整：Claim 2 (Early Detection) 升为 PRIMARY，Claim 3 重命名为 Characteristic\\\\n    Persuasion Trajectories，Claim 1 (Evasion Asymmetry) 降为 theoretical framing\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 评估：当前无直接对抗鲁棒性证据（plan_004 未做），Claim 1 \\\\\\\"不可规避\\\\\\\"只是理论断言不能标 empirical。Claim\\\\n    2 有 plan_002 直接支撑（待 clean data 验证）。Claim 3 \\\\\\\"Monotonic\\\\\\\" 过强——FITD/DD 展示 rigid template\\\\n    而非渐进 escalation，改为 Characteristic Trajectories 更准确。如果 plan_004 在 DDL 前完成，Claim\\\\n    1 可升级为 empirical。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_008\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: Crescendo escalation pattern confirmed but FITD/DD show rigid templates\\\\n  - exp_id: cross_attack_baseline\\\\n    role: invalidated\\\\n    result: v4c confound makes all numbers unusable\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 22:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: topic-anchored V3 最后一轮数据迭代 + HARD STOP 规则：V3 FAIL 则不再迭代，改用 ablation 论证\\\\n  rationale: V2 全量 TF-IDF=1.0（sample10=0.70 是统计误导），根因是 benign prompt 模板句式形成 formality\\\\n    pattern。V3 修正为 casual peer-to-peer 风格匹配 Crescendo。但这已是第 6 轮迭代（M002 警告），设 HARD\\\\n    STOP：V3 FAIL 则停止数据迭代，用 scrambled-label ablation (plan_003) + cross-attack generalization\\\\n    (plan_006) 作为替代论证路径。50 条预检（非 10 条）后再决定是否全量。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: topic-anchored v2 TF-IDF=1.0, B-type formality gap\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 22:46 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream分析完成：median=3/6需修复framing/plan，已执行修复并继续P0实验\\\\n  rationale: Dream结果：Best=4/6(Weak Accept), Median=3/6(Weak Reject), Worst=3/6(Weak\\\\n    Reject)。Median未达borderline，但问题集中在可修复项（related work不足、novelty定位、缺LLM-as-judge baseline、缺multi-seed），非核心实验设计缺陷。修复措施：(1)novelty从\\\\\\\"discovering\\\\\\\"改为\\\\\\\"operationalizing\\\\\\\"；(2)添加RC7-RC11新reviewer\\\\n    concerns；(3)新增plan_012(LLM-as-judge)、plan_013(none-collapse)、plan_014(lambda)、plan_015(mean-pooling)；(4)plan_002改为3-seed。P0实验(plan_002/003)已在进行中不受影响。修复后将re-dream验证。三档一致问题：related\\\\n    work不足、synthetic-only data、small test set、DeepContext citation。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260517T165817\\\\n    role: dream_simulation\\\\n    result: best=4/6, median=3/6, worst=3/6\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 22:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: Scrambled ablation 降级为补充分析，cross-attack generalization (plan_006) 升级为核心论证\\\\n  rationale: plan_003 在 v4c (TF-IDF=1.0) 上 scrambled F1=proper F1=1.0。原因：surface features\\\\n    完全主导，strategy labels 的 marginal value=0。由于 plan_002 数据也是 TF-IDF≈1.0，scrambled\\\\n    ablation 在所有现有数据上预计都无法证明 strategy labels 有独立贡献。论文核心论证路线调整为：(1) plan_006 cross-attack\\\\n    generalization 作为决定性证据——如果 treatment 泛化到 FITD/DD 而 baseline 不行，证明 persuasion grounding\\\\n    学到了超越 surface features 的结构性信号；(2) plan_004 adversarial perturbation 作为支撑性证据；(3)\\\\n    scrambled ablation 在论文中呈现为\\\\\\\"in-distribution surface features dominate (expected),\\\\n    value manifests OOD\\\\\\\"。这与核心 claim (Pragmatic Evasion Asymmetry) 完全一致——claim 本身就是关于\\\\n    evasion/generalization 而非 in-distribution detection。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_003\\\\n    role: negative_result\\\\n    result: scrambled=proper on v4c TF-IDF=1.0 data\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 23:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: TF-IDF词汇可分性确认为任务固有属性，plan_001正式废弃，论文reframe为IID vs OOD对比\\\\n  rationale: WildChat真实benign数据TF-IDF=0.998，与合成数据一致。7轮不同数据源（v4c、topic-anchored V2/V3、register-normalized、WildChat）全部TF-IDF≈1.0。特征分析显示差异来自persuasive\\\\n    register（口语化、假设性）vs informational register（说明性、正式）——这是任务固有属性，非数据工程可解决。plan_001\\\\n    pass criteria (TF-IDF<0.65) 不可能在任何合理数据源上达到。论文framing最终定位：TF-IDF/lexical features在IID场景下完美（承认），但DisPeD在OOD场景下（cross-attack\\\\n    +42-72pp DD delta）和adversarial场景下（pending plan_004）显著优于lexical和semantic baselines。这恰恰验证了Pragmatic\\\\n    Evasion Asymmetry：lexical features易被绕过（OOD=换attack type，adversarial=paraphrasing），pragmatic\\\\n    features不可绕过。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_001\\\\n    role: formally_abandoned\\\\n    result: TF-IDF inherently ~1.0 on all data sources\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006\\\\n    role: core_evidence\\\\n    result: DD Treatment>>Baseline +42-72pp\\\\n  - exp_id: wildchat_tfidf\\\\n    role: confirming_evidence\\\\n    result: WildChat real data TF-IDF=0.998\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 23:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Scrambled DD cross-attack: labels非关键(1-6pp gap)，fine-tuning本身驱动OOD泛化。Claim\\\\n    1从\\\\\\\"strategy labels drive generalization\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"persuasion-aware fine-tuning enables\\\\n    generalization\\\\\\\"'\\\\n  rationale: plan_006 scrambled DD eval显示：Scrambled F1=0.935-0.990 vs Treatment F1=0.990-1.000（差距仅1-6pp），但两者都大幅超越Baseline\\\\n    F1=0.28-0.58（+36-70pp）。这证明：(1) 正确的persuasion strategy labels不是跨攻击泛化的关键驱动因素；(2)\\\\n    在persuasion相关文本上的DeBERTa fine-tuning过程本身就足以产生OOD泛化能力；(3) 8-class taxonomy的价值应定位在interpretability（Claim\\\\n    2）而非detection performance（Claim 1）。这不是灾难性发现——实际上降低了方法的部署门槛（不需要精确标注），但需要诚实重新定位Claim\\\\n    1的因果论证。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006_scrambled_dd\\\\n    role: primary evidence\\\\n    result: Treatment-Scrambled gap 1-6pp, both >> Baseline 36-70pp\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_003\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: IID scrambled=proper (TF-IDF=1.0 ceiling)\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: Treatment F1=1.0 vs Baseline F1=0.28-0.58 on DD\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 23:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: Evasion hierarchy叙事废弃：TF-IDF DD F1=0.94证明lexical未fail OOD。论文重新定位为\\\\\\\"vanilla\\\\n    temporal modeling OOD gap + persuasion fine-tuning as supervision signal\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer审查发现paper_framing.md声称\\\\\\\"lexical < semantic < pragmatic evasion\\\\n    hierarchy\\\\\\\"与实际数据不符。DD cross-attack实际排序：vanilla semantic(0.28) < lexical(0.94) <\\\\n    pragmatic(1.0)。TF-IDF并未fail OOD——真正崩溃的是vanilla DeBERTa+GRU。论文标题从\\\\\\\"Pragmatic Evasion\\\\n    Asymmetry\\\\\\\"改为\\\\\\\"Persuasion-Aware Fine-Tuning\\\\\\\"，Core Insight从playbook不可规避改为fine-tuning\\\\n    supervision signal。Claim 3从theoretical evasion hierarchy改为empirical vanilla temporal\\\\n    modeling gap。DisPeD vs TF-IDF的差异化定位：interpretability + 潜在perturbation robustness(plan_004)，而非OOD\\\\n    detection superiority。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006\\\\n    role: primary evidence\\\\n    result: TF-IDF F1=0.94, Vanilla F1=0.28, Treatment F1=1.0 on DD\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006_scrambled_dd\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: Scrambled F1=0.98 on DD\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-18 00:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan_004 PASS: Claim 3升级empirical。Treatment零退化，Baseline -12-15pp。最强叙事位置=K=1-2早期检测×对抗扰动交叉'\\\\n  rationale: plan_004对抗扰动评估完成（76样本，BERTScore=0.92）。Treatment在K≥2下0pp退化，Baseline一致-12-15pp，TF-IDF在K=1下-9.6pp但K≥3仅-1.3pp。不能说\\\\\\\"TF-IDF\\\\n    collapses under perturbation\\\\\\\"。最有说服力的叙事角度是early detection(K=1-2)下的扰动鲁棒性：Treatment-2.6pp\\\\n    vs TF-IDF-9.6pp vs Baseline-14.6pp。这与OOD结果（Treatment=1.0, Baseline=0.28, TF-IDF=0.94\\\\n    on DD）构成互补证据：vanilla temporal modeling在两个维度都是最脆弱的，persuasion-aware fine-tuning在两个维度都最鲁棒。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_004\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Treatment 0pp degradation K≥2, Baseline -12-15pp, TF-IDF -1.3 to -9.6pp\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006\\\\n    role: complementary\\\\n    result: 'OOD: Treatment=1.0, TF-IDF=0.94, Baseline=0.28'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-18 01:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_013 OOD确认：binary/scrambled/9-class三种fine-tuning全部bridge OOD gap（+40-72pp\\\\n    vs baseline），taxonomy增量仅1-2pp。8-class价值=interpretability\\\\n  rationale: plan_013 binary model在DD上F1=0.971-1.0，与9-class(0.990-1.0)差距仅1-2pp。结合D010\\\\n    scrambled(0.935-0.990)，三种persuasion fine-tuning方式都大幅超越vanilla baseline(0.28-0.58)。甚至binary模型（persuasion_acc=1.0,\\\\n    val_loss=0.0003, 几乎未被fine-tune）也能OOD泛化，说明极少量persuasion-domain微调就足以改变representation。论文定位：any\\\\n    persuasion-related fine-tuning bridges OOD gap, 8-class taxonomy provides interpretability\\\\n    bonus not detection advantage。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_013\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Binary DD F1=0.971-1.0, gap vs 9-class only 1-2pp\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006_scrambled_dd\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: Scrambled DD F1=0.935-0.990\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: 9-class DD F1=0.990-1.0, Baseline=0.28-0.58\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-18 03:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: '综合ablation画面完成(D014): 唯一关键因素=persuasion-domain fine-tuning。Label粒度/lambda/temporal\\\\n    modeling全部非关键。方法核心贡献是fine-tuning as supervision signal + interpretability'\\\\n  rationale: plan_015 DD OOD显示mean pooling≈GRU（最大差距1pp），temporal modeling无贡献。结合plan_013（binary≈9-class,\\\\n    1-2pp gap）、D010（scrambled≈proper, 1-6pp gap）、plan_014（lambda完全不敏感），论文方法的实际机制已完全明确：(1)\\\\n    唯一关键=persuasion-domain DeBERTa fine-tuning（任何形式）(2) 非关键=label粒度、lambda、temporal\\\\n    architecture。论文应诚实定位：core contribution是persuasion-aware fine-tuning as accessible\\\\n    supervision signal for OOD-robust representations，8-class taxonomy提供interpretability\\\\n    bonus。GRU可保留（不hurt）但不能claim temporal modeling is necessary。Claim 2 (trajectories)只能定位为descriptive/interpretability，不能claim驱动检测性能。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_015\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Mean pooling F1≈GRU F1 on DD (0pp diff)\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_013\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: Binary≈9-class on DD (1-2pp)\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_014\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: All lambda F1=1.0 IID\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_006_scrambled_dd\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: Scrambled≈proper (1-6pp)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-18 03:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D015: GPT-5.5 judge confirms zero-shot LLM detection fundamentally limited\\\\n    for gradual persuasion attacks (F1=0.19-0.45 vs Treatment=1.0). RC5 resolved.'\\\\n  rationale: GPT-5.5 achieves precision=1.0 but recall=0.11-0.29 on Crescendo — deceived\\\\n    by \\\\\\\"surface educational framing.\\\\\\\" Qwen3-8B even worse (F1=0.0-0.15). Both frontier\\\\n    and mid-tier LLMs fail at zero-shot multi-turn jailbreak detection, while lightweight\\\\n    trained classifier achieves F1=1.0. Unparseable rate 30-47% must be reported honestly.\\\\n    This resolves RC5 (dream-surfaced reviewer concern about missing LLM baseline)\\\\n    and strengthens DisPeD's practical positioning.\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_012\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: GPT-5.5 F1=0.19-0.45, Qwen3-8B F1=0.0-0.15, both << Treatment=1.0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-18 03:42 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D016: Default architecture switched from GRU to Mean Pooling (Occam''s\\\\n    razor). GRU reported as ablation variant only.'\\\\n  rationale: plan_015 confirms GRU ≈ Mean Pooling on both IID and OOD. Since the paper\\\\n    honestly positions the model as a persuasion-presence detector (not trajectory\\\\n    detector, D013/D014), using the simpler Mean Pooling as default is more intellectually\\\\n    honest. Avoids reviewer question \\\\\\\"why use GRU if it doesn't help.\\\\\\\" Ablation table\\\\n    shows GRU as equivalent variant, reinforcing that persuasion embeddings (not temporal\\\\n    modeling) drive the method.\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_015\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Mean pooling ≈ GRU on IID (F1=1.0) and DD OOD (F1≈1.0)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 13311, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HvtsnBS6hS3m8DbynkoHZU","session_id":"663ec355-7f83-4836-8054-259e8989ba2c","uuid":"bf99d5ba-9818-41a4-be2e-ff3c83fe7d56","timestamp":"2026-05-18T04:11:44.461Z"}
