{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qid6GbMgxG7K6hJnCJK5tk","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/persuasion_turn_jailbreak_detect/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-18\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **plan_012_gpt55_judge** (success): Zero-shot LLM-as-judge (GPT-5.5) will underperform specialized trained classifiers at early jailbreak detection despite being a stronger LLM than Qwen3-8B, establishing that even frontier LLMs cannot match trained detection models ← 基于 plan_012_llm_judge_qwen\\\\n- **plan_015_dd_eval** (success): Mean pooling classifier (without temporal modeling) will perform comparably to BiGRU on DD OOD data, proving GRU temporal modeling is not necessary and persuasion embeddings alone drive cross-attack generalization ← 基于 plan_006_cross_attack_clean\\\\n- **plan_006_cross_attack_clean** (success): Persuasion-grounded DeBERTa fine-tuning (trained on Crescendo) produces transferable structural signals that generalize to unseen attack types (FITD/DD), outperforming vanilla DeBERTa baseline especially on structurally different attacks like Deceptive Delight ← 基于 plan_002_clean_training\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 13 / 负向 3 / 失败 0 / 共 16\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-33183: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1118, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018kmbDxFiMaa6UeHJ46Q57v","session_id":"663ec355-7f83-4836-8054-259e8989ba2c","uuid":"38951a1a-ddca-4ffb-bee5-77cd3b136ec8","timestamp":"2026-05-18T04:14:18.396Z"}
